<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>OpenWrt - 标签 - 秋至、枫以落</title><link>https://blog.iqzhi.com/tags/openwrt/</link><description>如果时间可以静止，我希望就停在此刻。</description><generator>Hugo 0.136.2 &amp; FixIt v0.3.17-30a67c4b</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 13 Jul 2026 15:21:12 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.iqzhi.com/tags/openwrt/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>从 ZeroTier 到 EasyTier 的异地组网实践</title><link>https://blog.iqzhi.com/posts/zerotier-to-easytier-private-networking/</link><pubDate>Mon, 13 Jul 2026 15:21:12 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.iqzhi.com/posts/zerotier-to-easytier-private-networking/</guid><category domain="https://blog.iqzhi.com/categories/%E6%99%BA%E8%B6%A3%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%94/">智趣随笔</category><description>&lt;p>我原本已经在用 ZeroTier，而且整体稳定。这次折腾并不是因为它突然不能用了，而是想给家里的 NAS、服务器和移动设备多准备一条可控的异地访问路径，顺便弄清楚 Tailscale、ZeroTier、EasyTier 到底差在哪里。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>最后没有做激进迁移：ZeroTier 继续保留，EasyTier 用国内 VPS 搭了一套私有中继，作为备用链路和后续扩展的底座。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>OpenWrt + OpenClash + AdGuard Home 打造家庭专用网络</title><link>https://blog.iqzhi.com/posts/openwrt-openclash-adguard-home/</link><pubDate>Mon, 11 Sep 2023 09:56:12 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.iqzhi.com/posts/openwrt-openclash-adguard-home/</guid><category domain="https://blog.iqzhi.com/categories/%E7%8E%A9%E4%B9%90%E9%9A%8F%E5%BF%83/">玩乐随心</category><description>&lt;p>搞了个低功耗小玩具N5105，做软路由刚刚好。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>